    "_metadata": {
     "name": "Matias Maccelli",
     "description": "Part of a strong rookie campaign with the Arizona Coyotes, Matias Maccelli scores an impressive goal against the Montreal Canadiens. Breaking out deep in the Coyotes zone, defenseman Jakob Chychrun sends a stretch pass to center ice where it gets redirected to a streaking Maccelli on the right side. All alone on the netminder, Maccelli makes a quick move before tucking it five-hole. Maccelli finished second in rookie scoring during the 2022-23 season with 49 points in 64 games.\n\nOfficially Licensed Product of the NHL, NHLPA, and/or NHLAA. All copyright, logos, and marks are the property of their respective owners and are used, under license, by Sweet. All Rights Reserved. [Terms Apply](https://nhlbreakaway.com/terms).",
